---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const serverIP = "liteplay.n1e.net"; 

let isOnline = false;
let onlinePlayers = 0;
let maxPlayers = 0;

try {
  const response = await fetch(`https://api.mcstatus.io/v2/status/java/liteplay.n1e.net`);
  const data = await response.json();
  
  isOnline = data.online;
  if (isOnline) {
    onlinePlayers = data.players.online;
    maxPlayers = data.players.max;
  }
} catch (error) {
  console.error("サーバー情報の取得に失敗しました:", error);
}

const allNews = await getCollection('news');
const sortedNews = allNews.sort((a, b) => new Date(b.data.date).getTime() - new Date(a.data.date).getTime());
---

<Layout title="ホーム">
  <section class="hero-container">
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      
      <div class="live-status-container">
        {isOnline ? (
          <div class="status-pulse-wrapper">
            <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
            <span class="status-live-text">ONLINE: <b>{onlinePlayers}</b> / {maxPlayers} PLAYERS</span>
          </div>
        ) : (
          <div class="status-pulse-wrapper offline">
            <span class="static-dot"></span>
            <span class="status-live-text">OFFLINE</span>
          </div>
        )}
      </div>

      <h1>Litemoa Server / リテ鯖</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">経済中心のクロスプレイ生活マイクラサーバー</p>
      
      <a href="https://litemoawiki.n1e.net/join/">
        <div class="status-badge-notice">
          <span class="status-title">現在開発中</span>
          <span class="status-date">8月中旬ベータ公開予定</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section">
    <h2>サーバーについて</h2>
    <div class="heading-underline"></div>
    <p class="about-text">
      経済要素や便利機能を導入してSwitchやスマホ、PCなどの様々な端末から参加できる「クロスプレイ」に対応しています。みんなでワイワイ生活ができるサーバーです。<br>農業や人口資源でちまちま稼ぐのもよし！一攫千金を目指して大冒険もよし！<br>商人になって売買で稼ぐのも良し！<br>いろいろな遊び方ができます。
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="features-section">
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="card-icon">💰</div>
        <h3>経済要素</h3>
        <label>ECONOMY SYSTEM</label>
        <p>アイテムの売買やプレイヤー間の取引で独自の通貨を稼ぐことができます。自分のお店を開拓し、サーバー随一の大富豪を目指しましょう。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="card-icon">🎮️</div>
        <h3>クロスプレイ</h3>
        <label>CROSS-PLAY ENVIRONMENT</label>
        <p>Java版と統合版の壁をなくし、PC・スマホ・タブレット・ゲーム機など、どの端末からでも同じ世界に集まって一緒に生活が可能です。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="card-icon">🏡</div>
        <h3>生活とコミュニティ</h3>
        <label>LIFE & COMMUNITY</label>
        <p>のんびり農業をするもよし、巨大な街を建築するもよし。Discordとマイクラの連携で楽しく会話することもできます。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 520px;
    background-image: url('https://'); 
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.4) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.9) 100%);
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .live-status-container {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .status-pulse-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .pulse-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background-color: #4ade80;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 1.6s infinite;
  }
  .static-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background-color: #4b5563;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .status-live-text {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #e5e7eb;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .status-live-text b { color: #4ade80; }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.7); }
    70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0); }
    100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(74, 222, 128, 0); }
  }
  .hero-content h1 {
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0;
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .hero-lead {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .status-badge-notice {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background-color: #4ade80;
    color: #022c22;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.8rem 2.8rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .status-title { font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.8; }
  .status-date { font-size: 1.05rem; }

  .about-section {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 6rem auto 3rem auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .about-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .heading-underline {
    width: 40px;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4ade80, #3b82f6);
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;
  }
  .about-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .features-section {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto 6rem auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;
  }
  .feature-card:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }
  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .feature-card label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .news-section {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 8rem auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }
  .news-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    padding-bottom: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .title-wrap label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: #4ade80;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }
  .news-header h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .view-all-link {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .view-all-link:hover { color: #4ade80; }
  .news-timeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .news-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    transition: background-color 0.2s;
  }
  .news-item:hover { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01); }
  .news-item time {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    width: 100px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .news-tag {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-right: 1.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .badge-maintenance { background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); color: #ef4444; }
  .badge-info { background-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1); color: #3b82f6; }
  .news-title {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .news-title a {
    color: #d1d5db;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .news-title a:hover { color: #ffffff; }
  .news-empty { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4b5563; text-align: center; padding: 3rem 0; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-content h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
    .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .news-item { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .news-item time { width: auto; }
    .news-tag { margin-right: 0; }
  }
</style>
